+! Simulated edge of member-a for the herd lab (#260, #659). Documentation
+! prefixes and documentation ASNs only. Each member has its own AS, so the
+! hub lists one entry per member. This router (AS 64496, 192.0.2.254) learns
+! 192.0.2.128/26 (path "64501 64510") and 192.0.2.192/27 (path
+! "64501 64511") from the upstream (AS 64501, 192.0.2.21) and sends them
+! over iBGP, next hop unchanged, to member-a at 192.0.2.10. The member announces
+! nothing: it runs in observe mode and the edge accepts no route from it.
